== Prestige class tips ==

*Barbarians make powerful [[blackguard]]s and [[weapon master]]s.
*The [[red dragon disciple]] class adds [[constitution]] and [[strength]], increasing the [[attack bonus]], damage inflicted, hit points, and rage duration. This requires that the third class be [[bard]] or [[sorcerer]].
*The [[pale master]] class adds survivability to the barbarian class, augmenting the utility of the barbarian's high hit points by increasing [[armor class]] and providing immunity to [[critical hit]]s. This requires that the third class be bard, sorcerer, or [[wizard]].

==Notes==
*While barbarians do not receive [[armor proficiency (heavy)]], they do not lose any abilities or receive any penalties if they do take the feat and wear [[heavy armor]].
*Barbarians are capable of capping the magic bonus to constitution and strength without any items, as mighty rage (+8) and greater rage (+6) stack.

